same test, plus a new AssertionError on a previously-passing test — root-caused below as 2 more instances of
the same unguarded-redirect race the original H6 fix addressed only partially (AdminUsersPage.editUser() and
ProfessorCoursesPage.manageStudents() both had it too). Fixed; re-verified in Pass 2 below.

