This is the same category of finding as the original H6 run's "can enroll in an available course" (PHY201)
flake: a Chrome-tuned wait constant not re-tuned for Firefox's own timing, on a different row-lookup in the
same describe block. Left as-is by design, same reasoning as the original finding — an H2 echo, not a code bug.

